Z||000026||terryk||12-17-2001||06:23 PM||||Theogre,<P>I agree. Seems like a bonehead move to fire up a dry engine. I'm the paranoid type (and rightly so).<P>Does Mobil even make the 5 qt bottle anymore? I haven't seen it in about 2 years. I got several cool Hot Wheels Nascar's there for a while!||||reg||1
